# The two libraries built from bhl-op4/ are deliberate, documented evidence
# (docs/BHL_BASE_BUILD.md). They are NOT the legacy dist/dlls binaries.
!build-evidence/bhl-base/client.so
!build-evidence/bhl-base/hl.so
# The Windows PE32 twin is also deliberate, documented evidence
# (docs/BHL_WINDOWS_BUILD.md). Linux files above remain untouched.
!build-evidence/bhl-windows/client.dll
!build-evidence/bhl-windows/hl.dll
!build-evidence/bhl-windows/SDL2.lib
# Playable BHL-root mod folder (supersedes the legacy OP4-root dist kit)
!build-evidence/bhl-base/mod/cl_dlls/client.so
!build-evidence/bhl-base/mod/dlls/hl.so
!build-evidence/bhl-base/mod/cl_dlls/client.dll
!build-evidence/bhl-base/mod/dlls/hl.dll
